\newlabel{tab:variants}{{3}{8}{Development-setting comparison of reporter variants (four seeds; P1--P4 primary, N1--N2 for null-control coverage); single evaluation each, not a significance ranking. Baseline rows are the evaluator's reporters in the same setting}{table.3}{}}
